<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">steal</ansi>

Attempt to steal gold or items from an NPC, or take from
a container without being noticed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">steal [target]</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">steal [container]</ansi>

Being hidden improves your chances. On failure, your cover
is blown and the target may attack.

Requires <ansi fg="skill">skullduggery</ansi> rank 1.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help plant</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help skullduggery</ansi>
